"settings.liveSourceTextCaption" = "Shows an utterance as it is being recognized. The translation follows about a second later, so this line is what tells you the words were heard correctly. A finalized utterance stays here until the next one begins, and leaves only its translation behind when it moves into the history. Takes effect immediately.";
"settings.sourceText" = "Show source text in the history";
